&_nc_oc=AdqsiXpFXXknJZ62OcP5tBj8OmhR-KpO5hQjK-f8qGffZp5-4FIWjuVXO69KUl4ANc4&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-dfw6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af0sl7YBfePCATs2AT0Bwh8msqAd1aqamPxbebTnLEKEeA&oe=69EF7DBE"}, {"file_name": "FS_Screenshot-3.png", "id": "1157916768541329", "uri": "https://scontent-dfw6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/57566684_1157916771874662_3154846063092592377_n.png?_nc_cat=101&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=Kkca8HJt_gkQ7kNvwFhhDii&_nc_oc=AdqOLheLB84HKRq6hrs7FKmnE374pnnHjF_9cKABYgi7ACXE10LVEHPqa4LTt_vXhIY&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-dfw6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af0O8dQnSK5-PclJLEwdg00gUCHpCzm-aQdp3cbxa1ms2A&oe=69EF567C"}, {"file_name": "Flipside-Meta_Screenshot-4.png", "id": "503354952327839", "uri": "https://scontent-dfw5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473394163_503354955661172_3675385292904393650_n.png?_nc_cat=111&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=afVKx_2_8RYQ7kNvwFeYeO3&_nc_oc=AdpHjb0ILeZnr_vsBBXHYsQMn_Ue8QOSYtu_tu1ZhnTYjWxKMV6q4Abfp4e9oTwgj3w&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-dfw5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af22D5ZxPDrWLefL_GXSRWLU_lDgp4peuGmiL3ixo6p4Kw&oe=69EF7507"}, {"file_name": "FS_Screenshot-5.png", "id": "377927191539358", "uri": "https://scontent-dfw6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39035465_377927194872691_2692247835418631299_n.png?_nc_cat=106&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=J1GmVG-8CzoQ7kNvwFOB2D0&_nc_oc=AdoMyw64dcdC9rUXkI2rZ2tDTAfLQJ0N7FuONwQ-GHsY5zyRul_SkoYp8b18-4-AXBc&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-dfw6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af1RqgcYbv41S7B0fIHy1TlT_jlDvYF5cCgJMfvWtpOozw&oe=69EF60D5"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "FS_Cover-Landscape.png", "id": "948055656716612", "uri": "https://scontent-dfw5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39001731_948055660049945_3697445677810051434_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=ZAoNjGr_Py4Q7kNvwE5QBFo&_nc_oc=Ado8PaXpFFRss8jbMdTfGgNsRAhhtH6LNRzIeciw1DI_tHXxb4MldXPb_I1sv8aEskQ&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-dfw5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af1UlMXH9NHQyswwWKwpF5O7WLP-AIHQyb2k8Iq2mtogsA&oe=69EF6D64"}, "display_name": "Flipside", "keywords": ["animation", "mocap", "recording", "metaverse", "social"], "long_description": "Flipside is the metaverse social media platform for next-gen creators and their fans.\n\nWatch a steady stream of spatial content, which you can like, subscribe, share, and even remix. Connect with friends over multiplayer and watch together!\n\nNext-gen creators make spatial recordings using Flipside\u2019s built-in virtual TV studio, then share them to your channel and build a fanbase of subscribers.\n\n# Highlights:\n\n- Browse, watch, like, share and subscribe to other Flipside creators\n- Remix other creators' posts, where you can replace characters with yourself\n- Send direct messages to connect with your friends and share content\n- Record full 3D spatial recordings, including motion capture, voice, props, music and more\n- An ever-growing catalog of built-in characters, props and sets\n- Generate custom characters with built-in Ready Player Me integration\n- Generate teleprompter scripts and custom sets using AI tools\n- Show tools including cameras, camera switcher, teleprompters, slideshow, and more\n- Audio controller to add music and special effects, including a built-in audio library or import your own\n- Use our companion Flipside Broadcaster app for PC to capture 2D content for other social platforms\n- Use our Flipside Creator Tools plugin for Unity to import your own custom characters, props, and sets\n- And too many features to list them all\n\nDownload Flipside today!", "short_description": "Flipside is the metaverse social media platform for next-gen creators and their fans.\n\nWatch a steady stream of spatial content, which you can like, subscribe, share, and even remix. Connect with friends over multiplayer and watch together!\n\nNext-gen creators make spatial recordings using Flipside\u2019s built-in virtual TV studio, then share them to your channel and build a fanbase of subscribers.